{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：16:02 2026-11-20 HKT<br/>發佈時間：16:02 2026-11-20 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：16:02 2026-11-20 HKT</p><img alt=\"希斯在烽火台督操。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/7cecac9b98eb3751ae8a49cd85d37115/2026-11/ee221ba3-ef5b-4e54-b0ec-c19d533fba8b.jpg\"/><p>早前去了紐西蘭揀馬的大衛希斯已回防，今早在沙田馬場緊守崗位，不斷來往機坪及烽火台二樓督操，非常勤力。而當助手策騎香港馬王「嘉應高昇」操練後，希斯前往機坪親自接馬，並跟出跟入，極為緊張‧</p><p>另外，希斯對以下數匹周日參戰馬也非常上心，今早艾道拿操「展雄志」、希威森操「天外富天」、助手操「包裝醒目」及班德禮操「火焰閃爍」；課後希斯更與艾道拿、希威森等騎師開大會，擺出搏殺格。</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ce06c24925ecf080e003aa3ce82aeca0/2026-11/9d393431-e89e-44e6-b21b-bd129985a23a.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/da10bdc95c2f77a8f84dd6fbb177ac44/2026-11/16a9b537-24f1-4e9f-8a88-884f35c60723.jpg\"/><img alt=\"「天外富天」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c51b94817905521ad30ce1a7f49909f1/2026-11/543eacbd-b79b-437c-acdb-31d85bb52360.jpg\"/><img alt=\"「包裝醒目」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6995ede0114d610c58ef046340aea923/2026-11/7059ebd8-b38c-489c-81f0-dbd83b8695f5.jpg\"/><img alt=\"希斯細心檢閱各駒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d87c8b70e65807173025d271d0925756/2026-11/64553b4b-f91f-4238-b67d-eb166cb883f1.jpg\"/><img alt=\"希斯機坪與騎師開大會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/86c4a931edd043631646a3939455b729/2026-11/acb2af1c-bc39-465e-b600-e7814d3c0bfe.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5fafd772a61a9e7316b196ae8a8d6dba/2026-11/b36cf1e6-5eef-4760-9824-247a3ec3ba02.jpg\"/><img alt=\"馬王「嘉應高昇」由助手出跳，精神奕奕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/57f6606a9a50f32b0e1532e82f8d3b31/2026-11/cd6160c9-d784-480b-920f-937c90a486e5.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e97719296adb50bcecfbae080e0e0287/2026-11/f14c61b7-2aae-4cf5-b4f0-2be082fb294a.jpg\"/><img alt=\"「火焰閃爍」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/724ce0808d96440cfbe7601576a6f6a3/2026-11/f81daae9-4eef-4e21-81d6-b96d2bb13aac.jpg\"/><p>陳嘉甜<br/> </p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T08:24:03.309425+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":281,"images":11,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T08:02:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T14:17:34.573647+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T08:17:24.292209+00:00","content_hash":"7d6e9a38a36eb898086ce6d679a4f9b0c093095ba2e7197d7051f3169daf5361","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}